@ShopAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5023
@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt
@userId = 1

### Create an Udhar entry
POST {{ShopAPI_HostAddress}}/api/udhar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "customerName": "Rahul Patil",
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "remainingAmount": 1000.00,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Grocery bill",
  "isPaid": false,
  "paidAmount": 500.00
}

### List Udhar entries belonging to a user
GET {{ShopAPI_HostAddress}}/api/udhar/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
